==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|богъ|tr=box}} {{ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*bogъ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|phon=бох}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-бог.ogg|Audio}}
* {{ru-IPA}} {{q|not recommended}}

In the nominative singular, the word is usually pronounced {{IPAchar|/box/}} (as if spelled {{lang|ru|бох}}) due to Church Slavonic influence. The regular pronunciation {{IPAchar|/bok/}} is used only rarely (mostly for pagan deities) and is not recommended. In all other case forms, the regular {{IPAchar|/ɡ/}} is more common, but older pronunciations used {{IPAchar|/ɣ/}}.

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|e|nom_sg=бог//box|voc=бо́же|a=an|f=боги́ня}}

# [[God]]
# [[god]], [[idol]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''бог''' [[он|его́]] [[знать|зна́ет]]!|God only knows!; goodness knows!|subst=бог//бох}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[бо́же]] [[мой]]!|oh God!; good gracious!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''бог''' [[с]] [[он|ним]]!|Forget him!|subst=бог//бох}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[давать|дай]] '''бог'''!|God willing|subst=бог//бох}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ей-бо́гу]]!|really!; really and truly!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ра́ди]] '''бо́га'''!|for God’s sake!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[сохранять|сохрани́]] [[бо́же]]!|save oh Lord!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[сла́ва бо́гу]]!|glory to God!}}

====Usage notes====
* Usually not capitalized in Russian in the sense of [[idol]], or when referring to a single god with a polytheistic pantheon. It is normally capitalized in monotheistic sense, such as in Islamic or Christian discourse (see {{m|ru|Бог|tr=Box}}), except for some common set expressions<ref>{{cite-book|author=[[:ru:Розенталь, Дитмар Эльяшевич|Д. Э. Розенталь]]|author2=Е. В. Джанджакова|chapter=III. Употребление прописных букв, §21|chapterurl=http://www.evartist.narod.ru/text1/24.htm|title=Справочник по правописанию, произношению, литературному редактированию|lang=ru|year=1999|location=Moscow|publisher=ЧеРо}}</ref>.

